---

## 🏗 Architecture Overview

This project is divided into three primary micro-environments:

1. **Frontend UI (`/frontend`)**: A Vite and React-based user interface featuring Tailwind CSS for styling. It includes core streaming components like a `VideoPlayer`, `MovieGrid`, and a `PaymentModal` for premium access.
2. **Core Backend (`/backend`)**: A Python-based database API that handles user administration, cryptographic wallet verifications (mnemonics, checksums), and automatic PDF receipt generation.
3. **Nexus Mesh (`/nexus-mesh`)**: A decentralized settlement engine with routing logic and adapters for Solana, Ethereum, and Algorand networks.

---

## 📂 Project Structure

<details>
<summary><b>Click to expand the full directory tree</b></summary>

```text
netflix-x402-package-staging/
│
├── backend/                  # Core Python API
│   ├── services/             # Admin, Algorand, Ethereum, and Payment services
│   ├── receipts/             # Automated PDF invoice directory 
│   ├── models.py & main.py   # Database models and entry point
│   └── verify_mnemonic.py    # Wallet recovery and security validation
│
├── frontend/                 # React + Vite Client
│   ├── src/components/       # UI Components (VideoPlayer, MovieGrid, PaymentModal)
│   ├── src/services/         # API integration routing
│   └── tailwind.config.js    # UI styling configuration
│
├── nexus-mesh/               # Blockchain Settlement Layer
│   ├── app/settlement/       # Network Adapters (Solana, Ethereum, Algorand)
│   ├── app/verification/     # Security (Replay Guard)
│   └── NEXUS_MESH_DEVELOPER_GUIDE.md
│
└── start.ps1                 # Master Windows deployment script
